_contains`.\n- You can revisit this tool at any point in the investigation; they are not only for the beginning.\n- Treat these tool outputs as compact raw evidence and verify them with the regular repository tools before finishing.\n\nNote: \n- Use the supplemental evidence to identify candidate files, classes, functions, and execution paths that may be relevant to the issue.\n- Cross-check it against the issue description and the repository evidence you collect.\n- Do not assume every artifact is important.\n- Do not assume the provided context is sufficient by itself."}, {"content": "Let's start by inspecting the raw execution-trace evidence to identify potential relevant files, classes, and functions.\n\n<function=get_trace_artifacts>\n<parameter=artifact_type>method</parameter>\n<parameter=path_contains>collections</parameter>\n<parameter=name_contains>LineCollection</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_trace_artifacts", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n{\n  \"instance_id\": \"matplotlib__matplotlib-29265\",\n  \"trace_summary\": {\n    \"unique_function_count\": 73,\n    \"returned_count\": 0,\n    \"filtered_count\": 0\n  },\n  \"applied_filters\": {\n    \"artifact_type\": \"method\",\n    \"path_contains\": \"collections\",\n    \"name_contains\": \"LineCollection\",\n    \"start\": 0,\n    \"limit\": 8\n  },\n  \"artifacts\": [],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"next_start\": 0\n}"}, {"content": "Since the initial trace artifact search did not yield any results, let's broaden our search to include the `LineCollection` class definition and its docstring within the `matplotlib` repository.\n\n<function=get_trace_artifacts>\n<parameter=artifact_type>class</parameter>\n<parameter=path_contains>matplotlib</parameter>\n<parameter=name_contains>LineCollection</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "t